<section class="hero">
  <h1>Disc menus for your own library</h1>
  <p class="lead">Rediscover the "Play Movie / Scene Selection / Special Features" screen. Each menu here is a small public-domain JSON file
  for a film or series. The <a href="https://github.com/peppy6582/jellydisc">Disc Menus plugin for Jellyfin</a> matches it to the right title in
  your library by its TMDB, IMDb or TVDB id.</p>
  <p><a class="button" href="{{ '/menus/' | url }}">Browse {{ catalogue.count }} menu{{ '' if catalogue.count == 1 else 's' }}</a>
  <a class="button ghost" href="{{ '/submit/' | url }}">Add one</a></p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>Pick a menu</strong> for a title you own and download its <code>.menu.json</code>.</li>
    <li><strong>Drop it</strong> in the plugin's menus folder.</li>
    <li><strong>Open the title</strong> in Jellyfin and press <em>Disc Menu</em>. The plugin links the extras for you.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Menus describe layout and structure only. Backgrounds come from your own server or the film's TMDB backdrop; some menus
  can use art files you supply, and those are labelled <em>bring your own art</em>.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Latest menus</h2>
